## Generated geometry

**M2_2280_card_envelope.step**  
Generated single-sided M.2 2280 SSD envelope for clearance checks.

**Coilank_AAPS0530.step**  
Approximate package geometry generated from page 2 of the AAPS-F datasheet:  
https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/db0306ba92d8c07b239ddfd67f0cd388.pdf

- Body: 5.3 × 5.5 mm, 3.1 mm maximum overall height
- Terminals: two bottom pads, 1.1 × 4.3 mm, separated by 2.3 mm
- Terminal thickness (0.1 mm) is illustrative
- Corner radii and markings are omitted

This is not manufacturer-supplied CAD.

